  "title": "Mini Croissant Crust Pecan Pies",
  "description": "Perfect for your Thanksgiving dessert table, these mini pecan pies have a crisp, flaky, buttery crust with a baklava-like texture... made with store-bought croissants!",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
  "date_published": "2021-11-09T06:24:48-05:00",
