    "description": "Try this bite-sized take on a delicious pie recipe. In this video, Chef John shows you how to make mini croissant-crust pecan pies. Start by making the filling with brown sugar, corn syrup, unsalted butter, salt, vanilla extract, and bourbon whiskey. Then, pour the mixture into the croissant crusts in a muffin tin and top them with roughly chopped pecans. The pies are baked until the filling is set and the crust is golden brown. The result is a simple and delicious mini version of a classic dessert.",
